MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Gorilla outdoor tape feels like a natural next choice because I have bought Gorilla tape before, and weather resistance gives it a clear use for outdoor repairs.",
    "The waterproof silicone sealant fits the practical sealing and repair needs suggested by my adhesive and hose clamp purchases. Its purpose matters more to me than the shared Gorilla name."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The COVID test does not connect to the repair supplies I am interested in, and I have no immediate need for it. The gloves also lack a current use, with uncertain sizing and an excessive quantity in the thousand-glove case.",
    "The polishing wheel and cutting discs require specific jobs and compatible equipment I have not indicated owning. The temperature controller, magnets, and electronic cleaner have possible practical uses, but none connects to a task I need to do now."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My purchases of repair supplies seem to have been taken as interest in almost any workshop tool, even when it serves a different task.",
    "My wire connector purchase seems to have been stretched into an immediate need for electrical cleaning, although connecting wires and cleaning electronics are different jobs."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Repeated purchases of tape, adhesive, and clamps give stronger evidence of interest in fastening and sealing than in specialized cutting, polishing, or temperature control.",
    "I choose supplies when I can identify a practical use. Equipment compatibility, suitable quantities, and fit matter before a broadly useful item becomes something I would buy."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my interest in practical repairs but stretched it into specialized tools and unrelated supplies without a clear current use."
}
